OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight heavy rain will clear
OL,6,Fnorthern areas early, staying mostly
OL,7,Fdry elsewhere. Showers developing
OL,8,Fwidely from midday, often heavy with a
OL,9,Frisk of thunder in places.
OL,10,FTemperatures around normal. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers easing off with some
OL,13,Flate evening sunshine possible.
OL,14,FOccasional clear spells overnight with
OL,15,Fmostly light winds, staying breezy for
OL,16,Fa time along coasts. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
